\par
The NexaMart analytical environment is built around\par
transaction-level retail data.\par
\par
The primary profitability dataset contains order-level\par
records linking customers, products, transactions, pricing,\par
discounts, costs, revenue, and profitability.\par
\par
The data structure supports analysis at multiple levels:\par
\par
- Order\par
- Customer\par
- Customer Segment\par
- Product\par
- Category\par
- Subcategory\par
- Brand\par
- Region\par
- State\par
- Sales Channel\par
- Time\par
\par
