9.3 DATA GRANULARITY\par
------------------------------------------------------------\par
\par
The primary transaction dataset is maintained at the\par
order level.\par
\par
Order_ID is the primary transaction identifier.\par
\par
Because multiple transactions can involve the same\par
customer or product, customer-level and product-level\par
metrics must use appropriate aggregation logic.\par
\par
For example:\par
\par
Customer Count:\par
Distinct Customer_ID\par
\par
Product Count:\par
Distinct Product_ID\par
\par
Order Count:\par
Distinct Order_ID\par
\par
Revenue:\par
Sum of Revenue\par
\par
Gross Profit:\par
Sum of Gross_Profit\par
\par
Gross Margin:\par
Gross Profit \'f7 Revenue\par
\par
