9.5 DATA MODELING PRINCIPLE\par
------------------------------------------------------------\par
\par
The Power BI model is designed so that business dimensions\par
can filter the relevant analytical data through appropriate\par
relationships and filter paths.\par
\par
Particular attention was given to Region filtering because\par
different analytical views may contain overlapping business\par
dimensions.\par
\par
The Region slicer was tested to ensure that regional\par
selections propagate correctly to the relevant dashboard\par
visualisations.\par
\par
Similarly, customer segment and sales channel filters were\par
tested to confirm appropriate interactive behaviour.\par
