12.5 GROSS PROFIT MEASURE\par
------------------------------------------------------------\par
\par
Gross Profit represents the value remaining after deducting\par
cost of goods sold from revenue.\par
\par
Conceptually:\par
\par
Gross Profit = Revenue \u8722? COGS\par
\par
\par
The measure allows profitability to be analysed across\par
different business dimensions.\par
